# The region between the markers is quoted verbatim in README.md as the environment a
# container platform hands the server. ReadmeConfigurationExamplesTests binds it as an
# environment rather than as properties, which is what proves the spelling. A backend's
# own variables are shown, and proved, in that backend's server module.

# tag::server-env[]
REDIS_ADAPTER_PORT=16379
